{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Timbre is a bite-sized 3D platformer that is a love letter to the genre and the late 90s/ early 2000s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through three &quot;void&quot; levels as you squash enemies, collect power gems, and try to find hidden seedlings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088740/extras/17d32b650e8d2716032ffe249936fe43.poster.avif?t=1767318872\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088740/extras/17d32b650e8d2716032ffe249936fe43.webm?t=1767318872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088740/extras/17d32b650e8d2716032ffe249936fe43.mp4?t=1767318872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic move-set allows for expressive player movement and flow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level builds upon the last- introducing new enemies, platform types, and power ups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful and original low-poly characters and environmental design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden collectables require a keen eye and skill to spot and collect.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4088740?t=1767318872","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088740/a25d4422e3c9e649a633a938e3f8ca30accfea52/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767318872","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088740/bdb391f6c8e314fc0c1b3beddeab27014794e096/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767318872","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as